WEBVTT

00:00:00.439 --> 00:00:03.462 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
TerraScope helps planners
choose where to investigate.

00:00:03.962 --> 00:00:05.720 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
Imagine a team in Madhya Pradesh

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:09.102 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
looking to store floodwater
upstream of a village.

00:00:09.602 --> 00:00:11.246 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
Where should the survey crew start?

00:00:12.157 --> 00:00:14.263 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
We search near Seondha
on the Sindh River.

00:00:14.689 --> 00:00:17.860 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
TerraScope loads terrain,
buildings and water,

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:22.800 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
then downloads September 2024 rainfall
and nearby river-flow history.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:27.255 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
Watch the date change as
historical model outputs play back.

00:00:27.755 --> 00:00:30.698 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
Their source, grid cells
and coverage are shown here.

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:36.287 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
The terrain screen finds
low spots near Seondha.

00:00:36.787 --> 00:00:38.629 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
Select one to inspect its shape.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:41.660 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
The card shows its footprint

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:45.691 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
and a terrain-based volume
estimate up to the spill rim.

00:00:46.191 --> 00:00:49.718 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
Field measurements are needed
to establish usable storage.

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:54.161 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
The cross-section shows the dip.

00:00:54.661 --> 00:00:57.540 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
A field team still needs
to measure the outlet,

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.531 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
check drainage and assess the site.

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:06.690 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
I built TerraScope with an AI agent
and published it with Embarko.

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:11.857 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
Try the live map at
the address on screen.

00:01:12.357 --> 00:01:16.200 line:73% position:50% size:80% align:center
TerraScope. From a planning
question to a place worth surveying.
